@gateway = http://localhost:5080
@catalog = http://localhost:5081
@ordering = http://localhost:5083
@delivery = http://localhost:5084
@notification = http://localhost:5085
@restaurant = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
@mohinga = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111102
@salad = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111101

### Restaurants through the gateway. Call twice and compare X-Service-Instance.
GET {{gateway}}/catalog/api/restaurants

### Menu, with X-Cache HIT or MISS
GET {{catalog}}/api/restaurants/{{restaurant}}/menu

### Place an order. Ordering calls Catalog over gRPC, then publishes Redis.
POST {{gateway}}/orders/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "restaurantId": "{{restaurant}}",
  "customerName": "Thet",
  "deliveryAddress": "12 Strand Road, Yangon",
  "lines": [
    { "menuItemId": "{{mohinga}}", "quantity": 2 },
    { "menuItemId": "{{salad}}", "quantity": 1 }
  ]
}

### Deliveries created by the async Redis subscriber
GET {{gateway}}/delivery/api/deliveries

### Notifications, including whether n8n accepted the webhook
GET {{notification}}/api/notifications
